      "problem": "Evaluate $\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(-3).$ **Do not round** your answer.\n\n$\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(-3)=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{-3}\\,+$ {{field-1}} $)$",
